  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - "\xA1Oficial! Remember me? Roberto, trumpet. The expired one. Not anymore! Renewed!
    It took all day and I had to play for the clerk."
  - The photo is terrible. I look like my father. My father looked like a potato
    with a mustache.
  - Today is a baptism in Anthony. Smaller crowd. Babies don't tip. But the grandmothers
    do.
  lineIfApproved: "\xA1Aj\xFAa! This time I play one for you, oficial. Right here.
    ...Okay, in the car."
  lineIfRejected: But it's NEW. It still smells like the printer!
  lineIfImprisoned: AGAIN?! ...At least I know the guards' names now.
  onlyIfApproved: {fileID: 0}
